ncreasing the diversity of the output.\", \"zh\": \"- **presence penalty**: 当该值为正时，会阻止模型频繁讨论相同的主题，从而增加输出内容的多样性\"}, \"name\": \"presence_penalty\", \"type\": \"float\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Presence penalty\", \"zh\": \"重复主题惩罚\"}, \"style\": {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Generation diversity\", \"zh\": \"生成多样性\"}, \"widget\": \"slider\"}, \"precision\": 2, \"default_val\": {\"default_val\": \"0\"}}, {\"max\": \"\", \"min\": \"\", \"desc\": {\"en\": \"**Response Format**:\\\\n\\\\n- **Text**: Replies in plain text format\\\\n- **Markdown**: Uses Markdown format for replies\\\\n- **JSON**: Uses JSON format for replies\", \"zh\": \"- **文本**: 使用普通文本格式回复\\\\n- **Markdown**: 将引导模型使用Markdown格式输出回复\\\\n- **JSON**: 将引导模型使用JSON格式输出\"}, \"name\": \"response_format\", \"type\": \"int\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Response format\", \"zh\": \"输出格式\"}, \"style\": {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Input and output settings\", \"zh\": \"输入及输出设置\"}, \"widget\": \"radio_buttons\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": \"Text\", \"value\": \"0\"}, {\"label\": \"Markdown\", \"value\": \"1\"}, {\"label\": \"JSON\", \"value\": \"2\"}], \"default_val\": {\"default_val\": \"0\"}}]',1,1,0,1755443706881,1755443706881,NULL),(65562,35,'QWen2-72B-Instruct','{\"en\":\"QWen2-72B-Instruct Model\",\"zh\":\"QWen2-72B-Instruct 模型\"}','[{\"max\": \"1\", \"min\": \"0\", \"desc\": {\"en\": \"Controls randomness of output\", \"zh\": \"控制输出的随机性\"}, \"name\": \"temperature\", \"type\": \"float\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Temperature\", \"zh\": \"温度\"}, \"style\": {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Generation randomness\", \"zh\": \"生成随机性\"}, \"widget\": \"slider\"}, \"default_val\": {\"default_val\": \"0.7\"}}]',1,1,0,1755443891328,1755443891328,NULL),(65563,36,'gpt-oss-120b','{\"en\":\"gpt-oss-120b 是本地私有化部署的模型\",\"zh\":\"gpt-oss-120b 是本地私有化部署的模型\"}','[{\"max\": \"1\", \"min\": \"0\", \"desc\": {\"en\": \"**Temperature**:\\\\n\\\\n- When you increase this value, the model outputs more diverse and innovative content; when you decrease it, the model output