nse Format**:\\\\n\\\\n- **JSON**: Uses JSON format for replies\", \"zh\": \"- **JSON**: 将引导模型使用JSON格式输出\"}, \"name\": \"response_format\", \"type\": \"int\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Response format\", \"zh\": \"输出格式\"}, \"style\": {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Input and output settings\", \"zh\": \"输入及输出设置\"}, \"widget\": \"radio_buttons\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": \"Text\", \"value\": \"0\"}, {\"label\": \"JSON\", \"value\": \"1\"}], \"default_val\": {\"default_val\": \"0\"}}]',1,1,0,1774922485915,1774922485915,NULL),(257706463479205902,257706463458234382,'OPEN AI','{\"en\":\"Multi-modal, 320ms, 88.7% MMLU, excels in education, customer support, health, and entertainment.\",\"zh\":\"gpt 模型简介\"}','[{\"max\": \"1\", \"min\": \"0\", \"desc\": {\"en\": \"**Temperature**:\\n\\n- When you increase this value, the model outputs more diverse and innovative content; when you decrease it, the model outputs less diverse content that strictly follows the given instructions.\\n- It is recommended not to adjust this value with \\\"Top p\\\" at the same time.\", \"zh\": \"- **temperature**: 调高温度会使得模型的输出更多样性和创新性，反之，降低温度会使输出内容更加遵循指令要求但减少多样性。建议不要与\\\"Top p\\\"同时调整。\"}, \"name\": \"temperature\", \"type\": \"float\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Temperature\", \"zh\": \"生成随机性\"}, \"style\": {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Generation diversity\", \"zh\": \"生成多样性\"}, \"widget\": \"slider\"}, \"precision\": 1, \"default_val\": {\"balance\": \"0.8\", \"precise\": \"0.3\", \"creative\": \"1\", \"default_val\": \"1.0\"}}, {\"max\": \"4096\", \"min\": \"1\", \"desc\": {\"en\": \"You can specify the maximum length of the tokens output through this value. Typically, 100 tokens are approximately equal to 150 Chinese characters.\", \"zh\": \"控制模型输出的Tokens 长度上限。通常 100 Tokens 约等于 150 个中文汉字。\"}, \"name\": \"max_tokens\", \"type\": \"int\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Response max length\", \"zh\": \"最大回复长度\"}, \"style\": {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Input and output settings\", \"zh\": \"输入及输出设置\"}, \"widget\": \"slider\"}, \"defa